  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><i><div role=\"note\" data-nosnippet=\"\" class=\"notice hatnote context-link about dablink\">This article is about the Side Quest. &#32;For the Event, see <a href=\"/wiki/Traces_of_Tides\" title=\"Traces of Tides\">Traces of Tides</a>.</div></i><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-stacked\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Traces of Tides</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quests\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Side Quests\">Side</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"requirement\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Requirements</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Complete <a href=\"/wiki/What_Yesterday_Wept,_Today_Doth_Sing\" title=\"What Yesterday Wept, Today Doth Sing\">What Yesterday Wept, Today Doth Sing</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Scale_of_Memories\" title=\"Scale of Memories\">Scale of Past</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"startLocation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Starting Location</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ragunna_City\" title=\"Ragunna City\">Ragunna City</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"description\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Description</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Fulmine, the manager of Wutherium Film Studio, looks worried these days. The deadline for the next periodical is around the corner, but he seems to have trouble picking the right photos... he beseeched the Laureate for help.</div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRewards\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tCharacters\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rewards\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"card-list-container\"><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Resonance_Potion\" title=\"Medium Resonance Potion\"><img alt=\"Medium Resonance Potion\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Resonance Potion.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d2/Item_Medium_Resonance_Potion.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524152915\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Energy_Core\" title=\"Medium Energy Core\"><img alt=\"Medium Energy Core\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Energy Core.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/18/Item_Medium_Energy_Core.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240524153056\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 2</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Medium_Sealed_Tube\" title=\"Medium Sealed Tube\"><img alt=\"Medium Sealed Tube\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Medium Sealed Tube.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/7e/Item_Medium_Sealed_Tube.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240529094325\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 1</span></span></div><div class=\"card-container\"><span class=\"card-body\"><span class=\"card-image-container card-rarity-3\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"74\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/d/d1/Item_Shell_Credit.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240523132525\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"card-text card-font\"> 3,000</span></span></div></span></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"characters\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fulmine\" title=\"Fulmine\">Fulmine</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rover\" title=\"Rover\">Rover</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><b>Traces of Tides (Quest)</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Side_Quest\" title=\"Side Quest\">Side Quest</a> that occurs in <a href=\"/wiki/Ragunna_City\" title=\"Ragunna City\">Ragunna City</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Rinascita\" title=\"Rinascita\">Rinascita</a>, [[{{{nation}}}]].\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Steps\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Steps</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Dialogue\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Dialogue</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Steps\">Steps</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li>Ask Fulmine about the photos</li>\n<li>Capture the scenery of Rinascita (0/7)\n<ol><li>Follow the clues in the Traces of Tides to complete the Rinascita photo set</li></ol></li></ol>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dd><div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-title\"><b><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"UI Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/0/0f/UI_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20260501180345\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"UI Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"UI_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Quest Description</b></div><hr class=\"description-separator\" /><div class=\"description-content\">Fulmine, the manager of Wutherium Film Studio, looks worried these days. The deadline for the next periodical is around the corner, but he seems to have trouble picking the right photos... he beseeched the Laureate for help.</div></div></dd>\n<div class=\"dialogue\">\n<dl><dt>(Talk Fulmine)</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Quest\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/a/ab/Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240531220619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Quest.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Quest.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> Traces of Tides</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Here you are! Actually, I've come to ask you for a favor today...</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> The deadline for the new issue of Wutherium Film Studio's publication is approaching, and this time, we plan to capitalize on a trending topic.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span> What topic?\n<dl><dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Oh! No need to be modest, of course it's about you— the latest Laureate in Ragunna!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Is it about me?\n<dl><dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Of course, you are the latest Laureate in Ragunna, after all!</dd></dl></dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> As you know, publishing is tough these days, and if sales keep lagging, headquarters will probably cut our budget again.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> We've been following your work in Ragunna and thought if you, the Laureate, photographed a travelogue of Ragunna, it would surely be a hit!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> So we'd like to commission you to take a series of photos for this issue to help boost sales.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Any profit from this will go entirely to you. Please, we're counting on you!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Alright</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> All you have to do is ask.</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Thank you so much! We've already set the coordinates for some of Ragunna's landmarks. I'll send them to you now!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Complete Traces of Tides I)</dt>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Have you taken the first photo yet? Let me take a look!</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Send the photo</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> ...!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> What a perfect shot! Brilliant composition, excquisite colors!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> Please, don't limite yourself to photography. What I mean is, your aesthetic should not be confined by the camera!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> This is where my good partner comes in! Mr. C-MOSS! With your permission, it can capture the scenery you envision. Please, roam Ragunna freely and collect the scenes that speak to you.</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Approach Traces of Tides II)</dt>\n<dd><b>Nameless Knight:</b> Forward, the knight's mission is to move ahead... I understand.</dd>\n<dd><b>Nameless Knight:</b> But the knight's attire has been with me for half my life. Now, who can give meaning to the knight's path forward?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Chat with the troupe member near Traces of Tides III)</dt>\n<dd><b>Troupe Member:</b> Oh, I didn't expect to run into you here. Here, take a commemorative postcard from the exclusive Ragunna performance.</dd>\n<dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Dialogue Talk\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Dialogue Talk.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/7/71/Icon_Dialogue_Talk.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20240529051922\" /></span></span> Thank you.</dd>\n<dd><b>Troupe Member:</b> This performance marks the reunion of Ragunna and theatrical arts after many years apart. When we first set sail from here, we promised ourselves we'd return to the stage one day.\" &#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93;</dd>\n<dd><b>Troupe Member:</b> Now we've come back, not to prove our greatness, but to show everyone that the things we lost will be reclaimed!</dd>\n<dd><b>Troupe Member:</b> You must come to the next performance, too!</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Approach Traces of Tides IV)</dt>\n<dd><b>Melancholy Figure:</b> This land is no longer where I belong. If the art I seek is truly a sin beyond redemption, then... where should I go?</dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Pick up the paper slips near Traces of Tides V)</dt>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"According to Montelli customs and requirements, this is a promissory note with no expiration, no designated beneficiary, and no specified amount.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"This note is a link to the Montelli.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"Stranger, when you find yourself in trouble, show them this note.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"As long as it still bears the Montelli seal, it will serve as a voucher for a grand reward in your future.\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"They may ask something in return...\"</dd>\n<dd><b>Crumpled IOU:</b> \"But their&#32;&#91;<i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/sic\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:sic\">sic</a></i>&#93; will also present you with an offer you cannot refuse.\"</dd>\n<dd><i>(The seal is worn out, it seems the note is no longer valid...)</i></dd></dl>\n<hr />\n<dl><dt>(Complete Traces of Tides VII)</dt>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> This is the final location for the last photo. Thank goodness you agreed to help — this issue will surely be the most brilliant since the magazine's inception!</dd>\n<dd><b>Fulmine:</b> But your story with Ragunna is still unfolding, and I truly look forward to witnessing more of your legacy here.</dd>\n<dt>(Quest Complete)</dt></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table alternating-colors-table\"><tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th></tr><tr><td><b><span class=\"flag\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Emoji EN Flag\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0